nges the verdict — a mutation replacing it with a literal 14 turns the guard red. And a domain declaring `needs_confirmation = false` is NEVER reported overdue: 2 of his 3 domains declare no consequence scale, and a standard that does not exist cannot go stale, so ignoring that field would manufacture 2 permanent false alarms out of a recorded fact. **AND IT GOES ON THE 2 FULL RENDERS AND NOT ON HIS SHORT COPY**, which exists because he said 22,902 words was an almost impossible workload; appending to it would undo the repair it came from. Verified by execution: the list is in the markdown at 76,454 characters and the spoken at 74,102, and absent from the 7,166-character index. **P-PASS: `bench/tests/test_the_reference_list_is_mechanised_2026-11-14.py`, 15 tests, on `hooks/pre-commit`; `scripts/the_reference_list_mutations_2026-11-14.py`, 7 of 7 red, 2 subjects restored SHA-256 identical.** The 3 FAILING paths are each given a fixture that triggers them, because the passing input cannot test a defence: an absent encoding, an over-age confirmation, and a scale-less domain that must not be flagged. ★ **AND THE HARNESS CAUGHT THE ONE OMISSION THAT MATTERED MOST, which is the 6th time in this window.** Every test first written exercised the PRODUCER, so disabling the generator's call to it left all 12 green — the guard would not have noticed layer 3 losing its only caller, which is the exact defect this work closes. 3 wiring tests were added and the mutation now turns them red. **WHAT REMAINS AND IS DELIBERATELY NOT DONE: the LOCAL instance.** The design calls for 2, a local one carrying whatever he wants and the repository one others copy. **The local instance is HIS content and inventing it would be exactly the flattering-design failure this project's record names**, so the repository instance stands as the worked example and the local one awaits him. **His standing instruction that he reads the repository version before it is committed is NOT discharged** — the 3 files carry no health, neurotype or identifying detail by construction, verified by search, but that judgement is his and not the harness's.
